        <item>
            <title>3.23.2</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 20:45:42 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>230</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.23.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New in 3.23.2</h2><ul></ul><p><strong>Improved</strong></p><ul><li>Free users can add a full batch of files to AI Rename. Files covered by your free credits are analyzed right away, and the rest wait for PRO.</li><li>Cloud AI names are more specific: invoices include the vendor and period, books the author, and screenshots the app and what it shows. Photos get a place name only when the file states it.</li><li>Names no longer repeat a person, company, number or date that one of your naming blocks already adds.</li><li>Start LM Studio now starts LM Studio's server for you, so you don't have to turn it on in the app.</li><li>Ollama and LM Studio give documents more descriptive names, and Ollama keeps video frames in its analysis.</li></ul><p><strong>Fixed</strong></p><ul><li>Zush no longer quits at launch when a saved template is damaged.</li><li>When Ollama can't load a model, the batch stops with a clear message instead of failing every file.</li><li>LM Studio explains why a model failed to load.</li><li>Pausing or clearing Monitor while it waits for an offline destination folder no longer renames the waiting files afterwards.</li></ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://zushapp.com/releases/Zush-3.23.2.dmg" length="20009870" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="3fVb0b66TMHMH2IbRsIev1ZRCiyGQPCVy3ZPUCVH/J/M2LKFFFSLXSbz51nY+s3FZriv3pOq5M0RADbQqv1sBw=="/>
